error[RB0205]: event `Go` is listed twice in `on Go | Stop | Go`
 --> RB0205-or-events.road:9:20
  |
9 |     on Go | Stop | Go -> A
  |                    ^^
  |
  = help: list each event once

error[RB0205]: trigger `on Stop` is written twice in `M.A`
  --> RB0205-or-events.road:11:8
   |
 9 |     on Go | Stop | Go -> A
   |             ---- first written here
...
11 |     on Stop | Pause -> A
   |        ^^^^
   |
   = help: put every branch in one block, where their order is explicit: `on Stop { if … -> A  else -> B }`

error[RB0205]: trigger `on Pause` is written twice in `M.A`
  --> RB0205-or-events.road:11:15
   |
10 |     on Pause -> A
   |     -------- first written here
11 |     on Stop | Pause -> A
   |               ^^^^^
   |
   = help: put every branch in one block, where their order is explicit: `on Pause { if … -> A  else -> B }`
